nally incl empty changed_files, preserving prior []; G6: scoped stricter validator to code_review project LLM only; T1: added prior-art grounding vs ADR 0098/0017 + _overlay_signature reuse; P6: split ACs). Re-review PASS, signed. Claiming.","timestamp":1787336736647681001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 Phase 4b RED evidence: test_criteria_snapshot.py (12 tests) errors on missing CriteriaSnapshot/compile_snapshot API (new-module RED). Migration contract test_repository_wide_consumer_selects_regardless_of_changed_files fails EXACTLY on the T8 diverging edge: project_criterion_applies('project.rpb', [], root)==False (want True). test_committed_review_phase_boundaries fails on unmigrated []. RED for the right reasons.","timestamp":1787337032829242001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 Phase 4e-4f: held-out oracle initially caught malformed-applies_to remedy gap (3 tests RED) -> re-dispatched with missing-behavior description -> fixed via raw-overlay code-review precheck before effective_routing. Full oracle 45/45 green. Teeth: removing the ['**'] unconditional branch turns both empty-changed-files tests RED (restored). Pre-flight: make lint clean, make typecheck clean (620 files), 154 affected-area tests pass.","timestamp":1787338030345982001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 60c1: committed 76ee21ebbd (rebar-ticket trailer + DCO + Change-Id I91c02d29), pushed to Gerrit change 2016 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2016). Local pre-flight green (lint/typecheck/154 affected tests). Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 (CI).","timestamp":1787338166199691001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 change 2016 PS1 CI Verified -1: Documentation gates failed (ADR 0102 missing .numbers/0102 marker + stale ADR index). Fixed: ran scripts/gen_adr_index.py (created docs/adr/.numbers/0102), verified all docs gates + criteria-routing parity green locally. Amended (Change-Id preserved) -> PS2 pushed. Awaiting re-run of LLM-Review + Verified.","timestamp":1787338553911222001}],"created_at":1787334518692690001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"61194cd6-9d0d-4f07-a0ef-25eb14f86b3d","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"58bd-d656-c52f-4cf4"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","58bd-d656-c52f-4cf4"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"4ae1-ecf8-3aa8-4993","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement uneducated-habitual-primate (RP-06): Unified effective-policy discovery for review gates","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a79dc62b-8438-40cd-9c6f-9e0d0632e21d","61194cd6-9d0d-4f07-a0ef-25eb14f86b3d","80f738bd-f236-462e-bbf0-f31311200bcc","cb2d167e-e215-43bc-ada2-f5d95ea63f22","6191bc67-2113-4cc5-b9e6-4e245bc23b41","2e26a0a9-10cb-437f-aae8-8c3e78210e04","e3d3620f-3130-49c2-a9d6-ddef44245c6d","f8802fb1-280e-442f-ab93-144ec5c24cc1","06722cce-1100-4b5e-b4d0-5bd6516b0d5b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787338553911222002,"uuid":"9ed9225a-1487-47ec-90a8-7cb949223543"}